The target <code>DataSource</code> must implement the <a href="#createConnectionBuilder()"><code>createConnectionBuilder()</code></a> method;
otherwise, a <a class="external-link" href="https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/java/sql/SQLFeatureNotSupportedException.html" title="class or interface in java.sql"><code>SQLFeatureNotSupportedException</code></a> will be thrown when attempting
to acquire shard connections.
